1
00:00:00,567 --> 00:00:02,302
I'm always grateful.

2
00:00:03,235 --> 00:00:06,239
You saved me with
the advance payment.

3
00:00:06,606 --> 00:00:09,609
Did I just tell
him everything?

4
00:00:09,843 --> 00:00:10,977
To this guy?

5
00:00:14,748 --> 00:00:15,748
I'm sorry.

6
00:00:16,149 --> 00:00:18,284
Why don't you take
a nap for a while?

7
00:00:18,284 --> 00:00:20,086
Just for ten minutes, then.

8
00:00:22,622 --> 00:00:24,324
Why did I say all of that?

9
00:00:24,324 --> 00:00:27,327
Why did I ask him if I could
call him by his name?

10
00:00:29,062 --> 00:00:31,064
In that case...

11
00:00:31,064 --> 00:00:32,031
Yijun?

12
00:00:32,031 --> 00:00:34,067
Did you change
Hye-won's schedule

13
00:00:35,201 --> 00:00:36,603
because of me?

14
00:00:36,903 --> 00:00:39,039
It's the small flowers
like these

15
00:00:40,173 --> 00:00:42,008
that really have good scents.

16
00:00:43,676 --> 00:00:45,678
I think you're like
those flowers.

17
00:00:45,678 --> 00:00:49,115
One day, people will
recognize you.

18
00:00:50,483 --> 00:00:53,553
Gosh, I'm working out
again from tomorrow.

19
00:00:54,154 --> 00:00:57,157
I'm certain it's because of
what happened that day.

20
00:00:58,291 --> 00:00:59,292
It's all your fault.

21
00:01:00,060 --> 00:01:01,961
I asked the boss about that

22
00:01:01,961 --> 00:01:03,839
and he said he's sending you
out to get more experience.

23
00:01:03,863 --> 00:01:05,063
It's not because he hates you.

24
00:01:05,197 --> 00:01:06,466
Really?

25
00:01:08,134 --> 00:01:09,202
Thank goodness.

26
00:01:09,202 --> 00:01:12,005
Unfortunately, it's me
that he likes.

27
00:01:12,338 --> 00:01:13,807
He likes me back.

28
00:01:14,407 --> 00:01:16,576
Maybe I'm being punished

29
00:01:18,878 --> 00:01:20,880
for being smug back then.
